# Obsidian's folder-notes plugin auto-creates <FolderName>.md inside any new folder
# it sees live (this repo lives inside the Obsidian vault). These aren't repo content.
# NOTE: any NEW folder added later needs its own line here (Obsidian names the file
# after the folder, so no single glob pattern catches all of them safely).
